WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.137 --> 00:00:00.970
(audience applauding)

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:01.803
- Well, I have to say this

00:00:01.803 --> 00:00:04.140
because I think this is very beautiful

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.110
and poetic and magical.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.700
I know that you and the late Paul Walker

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.260
y'all kind of have this thing

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.832
that's saying that y'all,
you wanted it to last 10,

00:00:13.832 --> 00:00:15.780
you were like, "How many
can we get out of it,

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.118
do you think, with this franchise?"

00:00:17.118 --> 00:00:18.180
(audience applauding)

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.900
And the goal, I heard the
goal was to get to 10.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.040
Is that true?

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.530
- Paul and I started,

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.673
let me take you back.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:33.470
We were in Mexico before the
first film had ever opened.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.810
We were sitting at an airport.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.250
Our duffle bags were at the side.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.700
We were sitting on the floor.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.660
We had just come from this place called

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.150
MTV Spring Break thing that they had.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.440
- Haha, I've done that before.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.273
- You know what I mean.

00:00:47.273 --> 00:00:49.500
- That's crazy.
- It was crazy.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.013
And he said to me,

00:00:55.538 --> 00:00:58.890
"Vin, take all this in."

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.960
As people are walking over our feet

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.580
and not looking at us.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.413
And he said,

00:01:03.413 --> 00:01:07.540
"Take in the fact that we have anonymity

00:01:09.184 --> 00:01:13.750
because once this movie comes out

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.165
we will no longer have anonymity."

00:01:18.165 --> 00:01:19.236
(audience applauding)

00:01:19.236 --> 00:01:21.420
- Aw, the pride in that. That's amazing.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:22.470
He believed in it.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:23.470
- He believed in it.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:25.680
He believed in it.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.513
And he would always say,

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:32.163
whenever we would go to a
premiere around the world,

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.360
whenever I would exit the theater

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.890
it would only be him and I.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.264
No other directors, writers, producers,

00:01:40.264 --> 00:01:42.480
studio, cast, nobody.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.820
It would just have to be him and I.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:47.163
And he'd always whisper in my ear and say,

00:01:48.187 --> 00:01:50.547
"Vin, the best one's still in the can."

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:53.910
And we were doing an interview in London

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:55.230
and they asked him,

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:56.617
we had just done six, and they said

00:01:56.617 --> 00:01:57.600
"Is there gonna be another one?"

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:01.800
And he said, "Vin, is
there gonna be anymore?

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:05.370
Is there gonna be a seven
and eight and a nine?"

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.310
And I said, "The question
isn't, is it seven?"

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.427
I'm gonna confuse you.

00:02:09.427 --> 00:02:10.470
"Seven, eight, nine.

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:13.710
It's, is it seven, eight, nine, ten?"

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.237
And when I said 10, he
looked at me and said

00:02:16.237 --> 00:02:19.170
"If we ever got to 10
we would do something

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.597
no one's ever done in cinematic history."

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.090
And now ten has come out.
(audience applauding)

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:29.700
- So it's incredible that, like,

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:32.520
I know he was there in
spirit and at heart,

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.170
but he wasn't able to
be there for this 10.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.480
But it's incredible to know that,

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.130
you know whatever you believe in,

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.277
he's looking down going,

00:02:39.277 --> 00:02:41.040
"Damn, they did it. They made it to ten."

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.180
That's incredible.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.369
It's an incredible franchise.

00:02:43.369 --> 00:02:48.369
- Kelly, it's so crazy.
And I'm so grateful.

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:49.800
You know this is a franchise

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:53.100
that's never had an inherited fan,

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.740
meaning there's never been a comic book,

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.177
there's never been a TV show.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:58.650
- [Kelly] Ground up.
- Ground up.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:02.730
And it's just from you all
and the love that you all have

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:06.810
that has continued on this.
(audience applauding)

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:10.897
And who knew that in 2023

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.270
that we would need a saga like this

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:18.483
to remind us how important family is.

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:23.670
How important it is to
love each other, you know?

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:24.503
Yeah.

